Malis goes to the market with Grandma. The durian smells very strong! A jackfruit is the biggest fruit in the market. A pomelo is sweet and sour, and a star fruit looks like a star. Grandma buys morning glory, water spinach and bitter melon for dinner, and kaffir lime leaves for the soup.

